From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mzak <mzak.amin@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 21:31:33 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 30/30] virtio input: iceland gvm: the default keyboard
 advertises Super (LEFTMETA / RIGHTMETA) and Compose

kit-vm22 K-3: with the keyboard grab active KWin passed Super to the VM window, but the guest never saw it: the
virtio keyboard's key bitmap had no KEY_LEFTMETA, and the guest's input core drops keys a device does not
advertise. Alt+Tab and Escape (advertised) arrived.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Signed-off-by: mzak <mzak.amin@gmail.com>
(cherry picked from commit e9ef261056ec22418e9e81dcac96cdcb766eed6d)
SPDX-License-Identifier: BSD-3-Clause
Copyright: iceland-gvm contributors; ChromiumOS Authors; Droid-VM contributors where noted in the diff.
Purpose: See the original Subject and rationale above.
Origin: https://github.com/mzakamin-hub/iceland-gvm/tree/7ae498c24e61a8860740d003572455a7443eecd3
Upstream-Status: Downstream iceland-gvm carry; not established as merged in upstream crosvm.

---
 devices/src/virtio/input/defaults.rs | 5 +++++
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+)

diff --git a/devices/src/virtio/input/defaults.rs b/devices/src/virtio/input/defaults.rs
index 410c1b5..ba8e59c 100644
--- a/devices/src/virtio/input/defaults.rs
+++ b/devices/src/virtio/input/defaults.rs
@@ -448,6 +448,11 @@ fn default_keyboard_events() -> BTreeMap<u16, virtio_input_bitmap> {
             KEY_INSERT,
             KEY_DELETE,
             KEY_PAUSE,
+            // iceland gvm (kbd grab, kit-vm22 K-3): Super / Menu reach the guest (the guest kernel drops keys the
+            // device does not advertise)
+            KEY_LEFTMETA,
+            KEY_RIGHTMETA,
+            KEY_COMPOSE,
             KEY_MENU,
             KEY_PRINT,
             KEY_POWER,
